units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
newton on
processors ${nranks} 1 1
lattice bcc 2.87
region box block 0 4 0 3 0 3
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass 1 55.845
region atorigin sphere 0 0 0 0.1 units box
group moved region atorigin
displace_atoms moved move 0.085 -0.05 0.025 units box
pair_style mliap unified ${model} 0
pair_coeff * * Fe
neighbor 1.0 bin
thermo_style custom step atoms pe fmax
thermo_modify format float %.16g
run 0
write_dump all custom ${forces} id type x y z fx fy fz modify sort id format float %.16g
